[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Public entry points.** `c_src/include/lib.h` is one line and declares exactly
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m one function, `custom_strdup`. It is simultaneously the highest- and the
